abstract: >
  An MIT-licensed, CPU-reproducible pipeline for hypothesis generation and
  in silico testing of MCAS/MCAD rescue, maintenance, and remission compounds
  across pharma, herbs, supplements, and AI-generated analogs. Includes multi-target
  ligand-based screening, ADMET QSAR, ChEMBL and mast-cell predictors, KEAP1
  Kelch + BTB docking proxies, recovery/negative-control audits, and a public
  Streamlit browser on Hugging Face Spaces.
